  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xEF06" flags="0x0">
    <title>EXPERT_Ignition_Per_Cylinder_Static_Offset_Vector</title>
    <description>[BMS46 v0.68 STRUCTURED VECTOR / CODE-DERIVED / EXPERT] Four bytes at 0xA9AA..0xA9AD are consumed by set_Engine_Timing_Advance once per cylinder/channel. The routine walks the vector in reverse (A9AD down to A9AA), adds the byte to the encoded ignition value, then subtracts 0x80 before applying the normal ignition clamps. Therefore 0x80 is zero correction and one raw count equals 0.75 crank degree. Q28G stock is 0x80,0x80,0x80,0x80 = 0 deg correction. The exact physical cylinder-to-storage-index naming is not asserted; preserve stock unless channel mapping is independently verified.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="2" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="-32" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>stored vector index</units>
      <indexcount>4</indexcount>
      <decimalpl>0</decimalpl>
      <outputtype>4</outputtype>
      <datatype>0</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
      <DALINK index="0" />
      <LABEL index="0" value="Stored 0" />
      <LABEL index="1" value="Stored 1" />
      <LABEL index="2" value="Stored 2" />
      <LABEL index="3" value="Stored 3" />
      <MATH equation="X">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
    <XDFAXIS id="y" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="-32" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <indexcount>1</indexcount>
      <outputtype>4</outputtype>
      <datatype>0</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
      <DALINK index="0" />
      <LABEL index="0" value="" />
      <MATH equation="X">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
    <XDFAXIS id="z">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x02" mmedaddress="0xa9aa" mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedrowcount="1" mmedcolcount="4" mmedmajorstridebits="0" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>deg correction</units>
      <decimalpl>2</decimalpl>
      <min>-96</min>
      <max>95.25</max>
      <outputtype>1</outputtype>
      <MATH equation="(X - 128) * 0.75">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
  </XDFTABLE>
  <XDFTABLE uniqueid="0xEF07" flags="0x0">
    <title>INFERRED_Knock_RPM_State_Band_Boundaries</title>
    <description>[BMS46 v0.68 STRUCTURED VECTOR / CODE-DERIVED / INFERRED] Shared six-byte RPM-boundary vector at 0x9E06..0x9E0B used by calculate_Engine_Knock. The 0x9E06 view indexes elements 0..4 using the current low-nibble knock state and applies 0x9DF0 RPM hysteresis on the opposite transition. The 0x9E07 view scans elements 1..5 to classify the next RPM band. Values are in the established Engine_RPM byte domain of 40 RPM/count. Q28G stock = 480,1440,2400,4040,5400,10200 RPM.</description>
    <CATEGORYMEM index="0" category="8" />
    <XDFAXIS id="x" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="-32" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>boundary</units>
      <indexcount>6</indexcount>
      <decimalpl>0</decimalpl>
      <outputtype>4</outputtype>
      <datatype>0</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
      <DALINK index="0" />
      <LABEL index="0" value="Lower sentinel" />
      <LABEL index="1" value="Band 0/1" />
      <LABEL index="2" value="Band 1/2" />
      <LABEL index="3" value="Band 2/3" />
      <LABEL index="4" value="Band 3/4" />
      <LABEL index="5" value="Upper sentinel" />
      <MATH equation="X">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
    <XDFAXIS id="y" uniqueid="0x0">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedmajorstridebits="-32" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <indexcount>1</indexcount>
      <outputtype>4</outputtype>
      <datatype>0</datatype>
      <unittype>0</unittype>
      <DALINK index="0" />
      <LABEL index="0" value="" />
      <MATH equation="X">
        <VAR id="X" />
      </MATH>
    </XDFAXIS>
    <XDFAXIS id="z">
      <EMBEDDEDDATA mmedtypeflags="0x02" mmedaddress="0x9e06" mmedelementsizebits="8" mmedrowcount="1" mmedcolcount="6" mmedmajorstridebits="0" mmedminorstridebits="0" />
      <units>RPM</units>
      <decimalpl>0</decimalpl>
      <min>0</min>
